    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1073">

                <pb facs="1101" n="815" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg815"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Turkey</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgenthau</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-19T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 19, 1915, 6 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1231. Your 1096, September 29, forwarded to Paris, October 4. French Ambassador
                    here now inquires what further action this Government proposes to take. Your
                    efforts and protest of Consul General at Beirut are approved. Cable whether
                    examination of French archives has been continued.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
